#!/bin/sh
# Plane tank with a small bottom opening, set up with celSetup (WP G.7):
# the case is written from planeTank.yaml into ./case, meshed (blockMesh),
# filled, checked with celCheck and run. Run again to resume.
#   ./Allrun            # 2 s simulated, about 1 h on one core
#   ./Allrun 0.1        # a short check: 0.1 s simulated
# Open planeTank.yaml in the setup page instead: ../../tools/celSetup --gui planeTank.yaml
cd "${0%/*}" || exit
tools=../../tools
if [ ! -d case ]; then
    python3 "$tools/celSetup" planeTank.yaml case || exit 1
    if [ -n "$1" ]; then
        foamDictionary -entry endTime -set "$1" case/system/controlDict > /dev/null
    fi
    python3 "$tools/celCheck" case
fi
./case/Allrun
tail -n 5 case/log.celFoam
